# ============================================================================

.koru-studio/

# Orphan-test staging. Swept into a ceremony commit wholesale by `git add -A`
# (2026-08, 74c9fd1d carried the 641_020 build artifacts); a staging dir is
# never a home for backend.zig / *.err / FAILURE runtime state.
.orphan-staging/

